From: Orion <orionopenwow@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] openvanilla: the sign-in page puts Play now first, then Google, then Discord

The owner's order (2026-10-22): free as a guest first, Google second, Discord for players who signed
up with it. A player Discord remembers ("Continue as <name>") still sees that button first. When
the Discord sign-in also adds the player to the Discord server (guild ID and bot token set, so
the scope carries guilds.join), the button says so.

